The plate held a Japanese-style curry with pork, potatoes, carrots, and rice, and it looks like a small portion. I estimate about 300 g total: roughly 120 g rice and 180 g curry with pork and vegetables. At about 1.4 kcal/g for curry rice, that comes to roughly 420 kcal.

The second photo shows an almost empty plate with only a sauce residue, so I estimate about 95% was eaten. That gives about 285 g and about 400 kcal.

